UPDATE companies SET description='Factory Furniture Company, based in Mauldin, South Carolina, has been family-owned and operated since 1964. The business was founded by the Kern family and has served the Upstate region for over five decades, offering factory-direct pricing on home furnishings by sourcing directly from manufacturers.

The company operates as a retailer, carrying products from more than 34 name-brand furniture manufacturers and offering over 10,000 items across categories including living room, bedroom, dining, home office, and outdoor furniture. It maintains a showroom at 729 N. Main St. in Mauldin and coordinates delivery directly from manufacturers to customers'' doors. The company also provides financing options through a lending partner.

Factory Furniture Company serves residential customers in the Upstate South Carolina area seeking home furnishings. Its customer base includes homeowners furnishing multiple rooms, as well as those looking for specific pieces such as bedroom sets, dining tables, or office furniture. The company works with brands across the furniture industry but does not manufacture products itself.

The Kern family started the business to help local residents furnish their homes without the markup of traditional big-box retail stores. By ordering directly from manufacturers, the company says it can offer prices that conventional retailers cannot match, and it emphasizes knowledgeable, non-commissioned staff who know the product lines.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Manufacturer-direct sourcing", "Order placement with manufacturers", "Delivery coordination", "Financing facilitation", "Product consultation"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Home furnishings", "Home office furniture", "Outdoor furniture"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded 1964 -> db", "Headquarters Mauldin, SC -> db", "Family-owned, Kern family -> /", "34+ manufacturers carried -> /", "10k+ items available -> /", "Showroom at 729 N. Main St. Mauldin, SC -> /", "Direct-from-manufacturer ordering and delivery coordination -> /", "Financing through lending partner -> /", "Non-commissioned sales staff -> /", "Typical response within one business day -> /"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We carry dozens of name-brand manufacturers and pass our savings straight to you.", "founded_year": "1964", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='factory-furniture-company' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in Minneapolis in 1945 as Elliott Auto Supply Co., Inc., Factory Motor Parts (FMP) is a multi-generational, family-owned distributor now headquartered in Eagan, Minnesota. The company adopted the Factory Motor Parts name through its participation in the former Chrysler Mopar distribution network of the 1960s, symbolizing partnerships with Ford, General Motors, and other aftermarket suppliers. From a single location, FMP expanded to over 300 locations across 35 states, with significant growth starting in 1993 when it grew from three to 32 locations in five years, entering markets such as Bismarck, Omaha, Phoenix, and Denver.

FMP distributes premium original equipment (OE) and name-brand automotive parts, positioning itself as a total resource for professional automotive repair. Its service portfolio includes dedicated support teams, the FMP Delivers online ordering platform, fleet supply chain solutions with GPS tracking, technical training, and a customer self-service portal. The company also operates specialized programs such as the Professional Brake Program, Battery Programs, a Stocking Program, the FMP Partners Network for independent shops, and the One Stop Parts Source Program.

The distributor serves independent service centers, car and truck dealerships, commercial fleets, wholesale distributors, and retailers. Customer testimonials cite shops such as Christian Brothers Automotive, Tilden Car Care Center, and Colorado Tire & Service as users of FMP''s parts and programs. FMP''s market coverage spans the Midwest, Mountain States, Southwest, Northeast, North Carolina, and the West Coast including Alaska.

