UPDATE companies SET description='Downs Food Group, a family-owned food manufacturer, traces its roots to 1947 when Tony Downs purchased a produce business in St. James, Minnesota. The company, now headquartered in Fairmont, Minnesota, has remained under family ownership for over seven decades, building a reputation on integrity, quality, and value.

Today the firm operates as a fully-cooked protein processor and co-packer of frozen entrees, producing both branded and private-label items. Its capabilities include multi-component ingredient assembly and volumetric filling, expanded through several acquisitions that added processing lines for a range of prepared foods.

The company serves major U.S. food brands and retailers, supplying private-label frozen meals and protein-based products to some of the nation''s largest food companies.

