UPDATE companies SET description='Finnu Designs was founded in 2014 by Josh Humble in West Fargo, North Dakota. The company began as a woodworking venture but quickly expanded into metal and stone fabrication, driven by Humble''s vision to create custom pieces that go beyond standard furniture.

