UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1992 in Appleton, Wisconsin, Flair Packaging (operating as Flair USA) is a privately held, family-owned manufacturer of flexible packaging. The company began as a market-driven operation focused on customer-focused innovation and has grown into a vertically integrated supplier with facilities across North America and Asia.

Flair produces rollstock films, pouches, bags, sustainable packaging, and tactile packaging from its integrated facilities, which include an extrusion plant, converting lines, an analytical laboratory, and an application lab. The company added 10-color flexo printing and solventless lamination at its 35,000-square-foot Calgary plant and operates additional sites in Lacey, Washington; Tlajomulco, Jalisco; Seoul and Pyeongtaek, South Korea. Capabilities span COEX and laminated films, lidding and thermoforming films, vacuum pouches, rotogravure printing, and custom structures engineered for hot-fill, high-pressure processing, and retort applications.

The company serves food and nonfood brands across categories including meat and poultry, seafood, cheese and dairy, prepared foods, snacks and sweets, baby foods, grains and spices, fruits and vegetables, coffee and tea, liquids and spreads, pet care, and foodservice. A stock program offers unprinted, ready-to-label formats such as FlairPak vacuum pouches and rollstock lidding films with lower minimums and faster lead times from strategically located warehouses.

Flair emphasizes collaborative innovation, controlling quality from extrusion through conversion, and holds FSSC 22000 certification (GFSI-recognized) with FDA, USDA, and CFIA compliance. Its ACTIV8 oxygen-absorber sachets and PE mono-material recyclable coffee bags illustrate a focus on shelf-life extension and sustainability.', certifications=ARRAY['FSSC 22000']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Extrusion", "Converting", "Analytical laboratory testing", "Application laboratory", "Rotogravure printing", "Flexographic printing (10-color)", "Solventless lamination", "Coextrusion (COEX)", "Laminated film production", "Lidding film manufacturing", "Thermoforming film production", "Vacuum pouch manufacturing", "Rollstock film production", "Sustainable packaging development", "Tactile packaging", "Oxygen scavenging film technology (ACTIV8)", "High barrier film engineering", "Factory Acceptance Testing (FAT)", "Environmental condition testing", "Graphics support", "Hot-fill processing capability", "High-pressure processing (HPP) capability", "Retort processing capability", "Custom packaging design"], "industries": ["Meat & Poultry", "Seafood", "Cheese & Dairy", "Prepared Foods", "Snacks & Sweets", "Baby Foods", "Grains, Spices & Baking", "Fruits & Vegetables", "Nonfoods", "Coffee & Tea", "Liquids & Spreads", "Pets & Animal Care", "Foodservice & Institutional"], "materials": ["Polyethylene (PE) mono-material", "Coextruded films", "Laminated films", "High barrier films", "Oxygen scavenging films", "100% PFA-free food-grade materials (for ACTIV8 sachets)"], "equipment": ["10-color flexo printing press", "Solventless laminator", "Rotogravure press", "Extrusion lines", "Converting lines"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Vertically integrated extrusion, converting, lab, and application facilities", "Family-owned, privately held with 30+ years of technical expertise", "FSSC 22000 certification (GFSI-recognized) and FDA/USDA/CFIA compliance", "S