UPDATE companies SET description='Florida Circuit LLC was established in 2000 in Sunrise, Florida, as a full-service electronic component resource company. The business began by offering kitting solutions and outsourced procurement services to electronic manufacturers seeking to streamline their supply chains.

The company provides a range of services including electronic component kitting with complete bill-of-material coverage, tape-and-reel packaging for component sizes from 8 to 120 mm, component preparation such as baking and dry-pack moisture barrier bagging, MPU and flash programming, light assembly, and various testing and inspection services including counterfeit mitigation and solderability testing. It also operates a vendor-managed inventory (VMI) program and offers procurement services such as vendor base reduction and supplier qualification. Facilities are ESD-safe and certified to ANSI/ESD S20.20.

Florida Circuit serves electronic manufacturers that need to reduce turnaround time, internal workload, and freight costs. Its kitting operation allows customers to receive a complete kit under a single part number, and the company''s procurement team sources components from manufacturers or authorized distributors.

The company emphasizes its ISO 9001 certification, long-standing membership in ERAI and IDEA, and a focus on identifying cost savings for clients. Its Rapid Kitting service leverages over two decades of experience in electronics procurement to deliver complete kitting solutions for build requirements.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ANSI/ESD S20.20']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electronic component kitting", "Tape and reel services", "Baking and dry-pack moisture barrier bagging", "Component preparation", "MPU/flash programming", "Light assembly", "Advanced inspection", "Component testing", "Counterfeit mitigation", "Solderability testing", "Vendor managed inventory (VMI)", "Procurement services", "Vendor base reduction", "Supplier qualification", "Box build final assembly", "Battery integration assembly", "Component alterations and preassembly part prep", "Custom cable assemblies", "Turnkey PCB manufacturing coordination (through third-party assemblers)", "Surface mount tape and reel services", "Rapid kitting"], "industries": ["Electronics manufacturing", "Electronic component procurement"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Single part number delivers a complete bill-of-materials kit", "Tape-and-reel capability for component sizes 8\u2013120 mm", "ESD-safe facilities certified to ANSI/ESD S20.20", "ISO 9001 certified quality management", "Counterfeit mitigation and solderability testing services"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2000 -> db, /about-us", "Headquarters in Sunrise, Florida -> db", "ISO 9001 certified -> /about-us", "ANSI/ESD S20.20 certified -> /about-us", "Member of ERAI and IDEA -> /about-us", "Services: kitting, tape and reel, component preparation, testing, procurement, VMI -> /, /about-us", "Serves electronic manufacturers -> /", "Rapid Kitting value-added service -> /about-us", "ESD safe facilities -> /about-us", "One part number for complete kit -> /", "Taping capability 8-1